  "details": "Adaptive resolution is where the the game changes resolution on the fly in order to maintain a smooth fps. This helps lower end GPUs like the GTX 960 keep pushing 90 fps. This could possibly lower the recommended requirements. You would have to implement a slider to change the lowest and highest it can go.",
